"That's {size} bytes, and Signal holds at most {limit}: letters such as å and "
"é take two each, emoji four."
msgstr ""
"Cela fait {size} octets, et Signal en accepte au plus {limit} : les lettres "
"comme é et å en prennent deux chacune, les emoji quatre."

